<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Openaccesscopyright  Policy - AJSMR</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f5f6f8;color:#222;line-height:1.65}.container{max-width:1050px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 20px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}h1{margin-top:0;color:#222;font-size:30px}h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:28px;color:#333}li{margin:8px 0}.note{background:#f0f4f8;padding:14px 16px;border-left:4px solid #555;margin:20px 0}.small{font-size:13px;color:#666}</style></head><body><div class="container"><div class="card"><h1>Open Access, Copyright & Self-Archiving Policy</h1><div class="note">AJSMR provides immediate free online access to its scholarly content. Copyright and reuse terms must be consistent with the license displayed for each article.</div><h2>Open Access</h2><p>AJSMR is intended to operate as a fully open access journal. Published scholarly articles should be freely available without subscription, registration barriers or embargo.</p><h2>Copyright</h2><p>AJSMR's existing policy states that authors retain copyright in published work, subject to the publication and reuse terms agreed with the journal.</p><h2>Licensing</h2><p>The journal should display a clear license for reuse. A specific Creative Commons license should only be named after the publisher has formally adopted it. Article licenses must not contradict copyright or open-access terms.</p><h2>Self-Archiving</h2><p>Authors may deposit permitted versions in institutional or subject repositories in accordance with the journal's stated self-archiving terms.</p><h2>Transparency</h2><p>Open-access, copyright and licensing information should be easy to find from the homepage and consistent across the website, article pages and PDFs.</p><p class="small">AJSMR local testing version. Final wording should be confirmed against actual journal practices before live publication.</p></div></div></body></html>